    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Latest updates and Item Chests (DLCs) are currently available for Windows.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time is your enemy. Strategy is your weapon.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sky Is Arrows</i> is a real-time tactical roguelike where every second counts. Control a powerful hero, command five unique army groups, and adapt to a battlefield that changes as quickly as you can think. The deeper you go, the stronger your enemies become\u2014and the more decisive your choices must be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Final Boss returns every five Acts. You cannot stop him. Only delay him. How far will you get before the world crushes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/576670/extras/8e71b414d8fdcb6f68636b32fcd2b8f3.avif?t=1743396272\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast Fights, Deep Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In battle, your units automatically advance and engage\u2014but that doesn\u2019t mean your job is easy. You\u2019ll reposition armies, cast high-impact spells, and make snap judgments about when to protect your hero or push for victory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a squad of five armies with over 40 unique units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have your armies cover your hero\u2019s weaknesses\u2014and let your hero cover theirs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leverage terrain, counter unit types, and time your abilities for maximum effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from four distinct army factions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Regiment</strong>: The human faction led by <strong>Sir Roland</strong>, known for discipline and defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wyrm</strong>:<strong>\u00a0</strong>Servants of <strong>Aldruin</strong>, the dragonkin faction wielding fire, poison, and brute force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Curator</strong>: The mystical elven faction, aligned with the forces of nature herself</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each battle is short\u201410 seconds to 2 minutes\u2014but packed with tactical decisions. The rhythm is fast, but never shallow. A full game may last 5 minutes - 30 minutes depending on the player's skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tactical Drafting and Item Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While exploring the map, you\u2019ll discover chests containing 1 to 3 randomized items\u2014then choose one. Most items can be stacked up to 30 times, while others are unique or exclusive to specific maps and DLCs. There are 73 items in total:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">41 Core items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Dragon Bracer items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Celestial Bow items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Ebonhare Visage items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/576670/extras/9d222aebd030a2ba2f9d0e706ae0fdd0.avif?t=1743396272\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longer you spend choosing, the harder the game gets. Every second matters\u2014even between battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">No Two Runs Are the Same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Act brings new terrain, enemy combinations, and unpredictable modifiers. You\u2019ll explore haunted graveyards, storm-wracked battlegrounds, corrupted shrines, and other ever-changing environments. Battles escalate. Tension rises. Heroes fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll encounter the Final Boss. Defeat him\u2026 and keep going. He will return. The game never truly ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Heroes That Change Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your hero carefully. Each one alters your entire approach to combat.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Templar</strong> breaks through enemy lines with holy strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Succubus</strong> manipulates enemies with fire and charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Ranger</strong> blends nature\u2019s speed with rapid-fire attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Zypher</strong> reshapes the battlefield with storms and frost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Marauder</strong>, <strong>Gargoyle</strong>, <strong>Hunter</strong>, <strong>Lizardman</strong>, and <strong>Archer</strong> each bring their own mechanics and synergy trees</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hero determines what units and items you\u2019ll gravitate toward\u2014and what strategies you\u2019ll need to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I wanted to create a game where decisions matter more than reflexes. Where pressure is constant\u2014sometimes even chaotic.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sky Is Arrows rewards clarity under fire... and punishes hesitation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 <strong>Yale</strong>, Creator of <i>Sky Is Arrows</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time tactics meets roguelike escalation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 heroes with distinct spellkits and army synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ army units with unique abilities, from siege Treants to flying Thunderhawks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">73 items with stacking, randomness, and combo potential</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Map-specific treasures and DLC-exclusive builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battles that are fast and readable, but always demanding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One-time purchase, no microtransactions</p></li></ul>",
