p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your hero carefully. Each one alters your entire approach to combat.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Templar</strong> breaks through enemy lines with holy strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Succubus</strong> manipulates enemies with fire and charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Ranger</strong> blends nature\u2019s speed with rapid-fire attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Zypher</strong> reshapes the battlefield with storms and frost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Marauder</strong>, <strong>Gargoyle</strong>, <strong>Hunter</strong>, <strong>Lizardman</strong>, and <strong>Archer</strong> each bring their own mechanics and synergy trees</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hero determines what units and items you\u2019ll gravitate toward\u2014and what strategies you\u2019ll need to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I wanted to create a game where decisions matter more than reflexes. Where pressure is constant\u2014sometimes even chaotic.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sky Is Arrows rewards clarity under fire... and punishes hesitation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 <strong>Yale</strong>, Creator of <i>Sky Is Arrows</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time tactics meets roguelike escalation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 heroes with distinct spellkits and army synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ army units with unique abilities, from siege Treants to flying Thunderhawks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">73 items with stacking, randomness, and combo potential</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Map-specific treasures and DLC-exclusive builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battles that are fast and readable, but always demanding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One-time purchase, no microtransactions</p></li></ul>",
